            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dining in Edfu"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Edfu, a town rich in history and culture along the Nile River, offers a delightful array of dining experiences. The heart of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " culinary scene lies in its bustling main square, where a popular kebab restaurant is known for its sizzling, savory skewers—perfect for indulging in authentic Egyptian flavors."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/edfu-travel-guide/weather-planning/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/edfu/edfu-seasonal-guide",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000009"
              ],
              "text": "Along the scenic"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " waterfront of Sharia an-Nil, visitors will find a charming line of cafeterias ideal for casual dining. These spots offer not only delicious local fare but also "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "serene views of the Nile"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Among them is "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Koko Internet Cafe"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", a modern venue where guests can enjoy a meal while staying connected online."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/historical-sites-visited-by-a-nile-cruise/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/nairu-kuruzu-de-otozureru-rekishi-iseki",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "em"
              ],
              "text": "Pro Tip:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Always ask about prices before ordering to ensure a pleasant experience. For fresh produce lovers, the daily fruit and vegetable souq just off the main square is a vibrant stop where you can find locally grown ingredients."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Horus Hotel: A Cozy Retreat"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000023",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For accommodation, the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Horus Hotel"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " stands out as the premier choice in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001a"
              ],
              "text": "Edfu"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Conveniently located opposite the Omar Effendi department store, this "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "hotel offers comfort and accessibility"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Rooms are "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000020"
              ],
              "text": "located on the upper"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " floors, are bright and clean, and come with either fans or air conditioning. All guests share spotless, well-kept bathrooms."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
