        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "What truly sets the Horus Hotel apart is its welcoming atmosphere. The staff are renowned for their hospitality, making guests feel right at home. The "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000025"
              ],
              "text": "hotel’s in-house restaurant offers a higher standard"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " of dining than other local eateries, with a diverse menu that appeals to a range of tastes—all served in a friendly and comfortable setting."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/the-definitive-guide-to-egypt-nile-cruise/"
