        {
          "_key": "000000000035",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In Edfu, a "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002c"
              ],
              "text": "town steeped in ancient Egyptian"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " heritage, the food and accommodation options reflect its rich cultural tapestry and hospitality. From kebabs in the main square and riverside dining on Sharia an-Nil to a restful night at the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002f"
              ],
              "text": "Horus"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Hotel, every aspect of Edfu promises to enhance your "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000032"
              ],
              "text": "journey through this enchanting"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
